{"id":"mbev6c95nlee2bq8me0oc7z1l","title":"从庞大主机到自动分析：20世纪50年代早期气相色谱仪","originalTitle":null,"summary":"20世纪50年代，气相色谱仪由色谱柱、加热装置等组成，体积较大且操作复杂。早期仪器使用热导检测器，通过记录纸带上的峰来分析样品成分。随着技术进步，气相色谱逐渐变得更灵敏、稳定和易于操作，为现代气相色谱奠定了基础。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3549522&do=blog&id=1560663"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T04:07:32.655Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T04:07:32.655Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表"],"score":17,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}